  "details": "When Focus view is left enabled, desktop (ingame only) the up and down keys will move input field text as if there's a scroll option (despite navigation being set to none and no scroll option enabled). For my own world I fixed this by disabling Focus view.\n\nto replicate the issue ingame:\n\nMake an input field with the text set to wrapping enabled + overflow set to something like masked/truncate or elipsis. Set navigation to none on the input field. Now In-game as a desktop user (this bug doesnt exist in editor with client sim), hover the mouse over the input field and press down or up on movement and you'll see the text scroll and disappear.",
